# The exec calls outside the child owner that are meant.  Checked by
# tests/check-child-fds.sh.
#
#   file|call|count|pass|reason
#
# "count" is how many such calls the file has: more or fewer fails, and a line
# that matches nothing is stale.  "keep" is a permanent exception.

test_watchdog.c|execl|1|keep|the victim the watchdog row starts: a test's own program, not a program the editor starts
